flowchart TB
  client[Agent / SDK / MCP Client] --> api[FastAPI REST / MCP]
  ui[Next.js Control Plane] --> api
  api --> retain[Retain: facts / entities / embeddings]
  api --> recall[Recall: semantic / keyword / graph / temporal]
  api --> reflect[Reflect: retrieval and model reasoning]
  api --> worker[Native Worker: async jobs]
  retain --> pg[(PostgreSQL + vector / text indexes)]
  recall --> pg
  reflect --> pg
  worker --> pg
  retain --> model[LLM / Embedding / Reranker endpoints]
  recall --> model
  reflect --> model
  worker --> model
  api -. metrics / optional traces .-> obs[Approved observability backend]
